          <attvalue for="33" value="+" />
          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained increases in US naval operations and kinetic activity around Iran prompt China to expand naval escort missions, increase intelligence and diplomatic pressure to protect its shipping and energy links, and generate more frequent operational encounters and contestation with US forces, raising overall US–China competition." />
