          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalating trade controls, sanctions and blockades targeting maritime-linked counterparties increase compliance costs and counterparty risk, encouraging dealers and asset managers to reduce market-making inventories and withdraw from affected securities, degrading bond market liquidity." />
