          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Broad or secondary sanctions on banks, clearinghouses or commodity flows disrupt cross‑border repo, collateral mobility and dealer balance‑sheet access, producing immediate deterioration in fixed‑income market depth and execution capacity." />
