          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher long-term government yields raise sovereign borrowing costs and near‑term fiscal pressure in donor countries, slowing approvals and disbursements for large weapons purchases and aid packages destined for the theatre." />
