          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising crude export flows from non‑Russian suppliers lower import prices and fiscal/market pressure on buyers, freeing budgetary resources and political capital that governments can divert to increase deliveries of arms and military aid into the Ukraine theatre." />
